@startuml
title Strijder Vision system context
left to right direction
skinparam backgroundColor #0B0B0F
skinparam defaultFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam ArrowColor #C89B3C
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #D8C184
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #171922
skinparam rectangleFontColor #F4F1E8
skinparam cloudBorderColor #9A79C9
skinparam cloudBackgroundColor #191522
skinparam cloudFontColor #F4F1E8

actor "Vehicle operator" as Operator
actor Dispatcher
actor "Fleet / evidence admin" as Admin

rectangle "Vehicle" {
  rectangle "Strijder Vision Pro EVS" as EVS
  rectangle "Cadmium MDT" as MDT
  rectangle "Vehicle I/O and\nlighting interface" as IO
  rectangle "Cameras and sensors" as Sensors
}

cloud "Cadmium services" as CADCloud
cloud "Optional fleet / evidence\ncontrol plane" as Cloud
rectangle "Dispatch Console" as Dispatch
rectangle "Vehicle networks and\nexternal lighting power" as Vehicle

Operator --> EVS : authenticate / review / mark event
Operator --> MDT : assignment / status / route
Sensors --> EVS : media / position / observations
EVS --> IO : authenticated named requests
IO <--> Vehicle : sense / protected control
MDT <--> CADCloud : calls / units / messages
Dispatch <--> CADCloud
Dispatcher --> Dispatch
EVS <--> Cloud : policy / health / evidence
Admin --> Cloud
MDT <--> EVS : context / health / event association

note bottom of EVS
  Local recording and policy continue offline.
  Cloud and CAD are not safety dependencies.
end note
@enduml
